      "title": "Server vs Client Components: Mental Model",
      "role": "outline",
      "outlineIndex": 0,
      "pages": [
        {
          "title": "Server vs Client Components: Mental Model",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. Two Kinds of Component",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "{green:Server Component} = ==default== in the App Router",
                "Renders **only on the server**; ships no component JS",
                "Can be `async` and `await` data directly",
                "{blue:Client Component} opts in with ==`'use client'`==",
                "Pre-rendered to HTML on the server, then **hydrates** in the browser"
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "frame": "dashed",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "diagram",
              "kind": "flow",
              "spec": {
                "nodes": [
                  {
                    "text": "Server render",
                    "sub": "Server + Client",
                    "ink": "green"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "HTML sent",
                    "sub": "first paint",
                    "ink": "blue"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Hydrate",
                    "sub": "Client only",
                    "ink": "purple"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. What Each Can Do",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "",
                "Server",
                "Client"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "Data",
                  "`async`/`await`, DB, secrets, filesystem",
                  "fetch from the browser"
                ],
                [
                  "State",
                  "none",
                  "`useState`, `useEffect`, context"
                ],
                [
                  "Events",
                  "none",
                  "`onClick` and other handlers"
                ],
                [
                  "Browser APIs",
                  "none",
                  "`window`, `localStorage`"
                ],
                [
                  "JS shipped",
                  "{green:zero}",
                  "{red:in the bundle}"
                ]
              ],
              "frame": "dashed"
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "lang": "tsx",
              "lines": [
                "// Server Component: no directive, async",
                "export default async function Page() {",
                "  const posts = await db.post.findMany()",
                "  return <PostList posts={posts} />",
                "}"
              ],
              "note": "awaits data directly, no useEffect"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Which One Do I Need?",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "Needs",
                "Use"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "State, effects, `onClick`, browser APIs",
                  "{blue:Client}"
                ],
                [
                  "Just fetches and displays data",
                  "{green:Server}"
                ]
              ],
              "highlightRow": 1
            },
            {
              "type": "callout",
              "style": "sticky",
              "title": "Mistake: 'client' means browser-only",
              "text": "Client Components are **still pre-rendered on the server**. Only ==Server Components never hydrate==."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "The 'use client' Boundary",
      "role": "outline",
      "outlineIndex": 1,
      "pages": [
        {
          "title": "The 'use client' Boundary",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. The Directive",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "`'use client'` must be the ==first line== of the file, above imports",
                "It marks a ==boundary entry point==, not a single component",
                "Everything the file imports joins the **client bundle**",
                "So no directive on each child"
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "frame": "dashed",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "lang": "tsx",
              "lines": [
                "'use client'",
                "import { useState } from 'react'",
                "import Chart from './Chart' // client too",
                "",
                "export default function Panel() {",
                "  const [n, setN] = useState(0)",
                "}"
              ],
              "note": "Chart needs no directive of its own"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. Import Direction",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "Importer",
                "Imports",
                "Result"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "Server",
                  "Client",
                  "{green:OK}"
                ],
                [
                  "Client",
                  "Client",
                  "{green:OK}"
                ],
                [
                  "Client",
                  "Server",
                  "{red:NO}: it becomes client code"
                ]
              ],
              "highlightRow": 2
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Mistakes",
              "ink": "red"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Hooks or handlers without `'use client'` → build error: `You're importing a component that needs useState`",
                "`'use client'` on a layout or page \"to make it work\" pulls the ==whole subtree== into the bundle"
              ],
              "style": "cross",
              "frame": "dashed",
              "ink": "red"
            },
            {
              "type": "callout",
              "style": "sticky",
              "title": "Push it down",
              "text": "Put `'use client'` on small ==leaf components==. Keep layouts and pages on the server."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Passing Props Across the Boundary",
      "role": "outline",
      "outlineIndex": 2,
      "pages": [
        {
          "title": "Passing Props Across the Boundary",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. What Can Cross",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Server to Client props must be ==serializable==",
                "{green:OK}: strings, numbers, booleans, plain objects/arrays",
                "{green:OK}: `Date`, `Map`/`Set`, Promises, JSX elements",
                "{red:No}: functions, class instances, event handlers",
                "Exception: Server Actions marked `'use server'`"
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "frame": "dashed",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. Example",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "lang": "tsx",
              "lines": [
                "// in a Server Component",
                "<Counter initial={await getCount()} />",
                "// works: a number",
                "<Button onClick={() => save()} />",
                "// error: a function"
              ],
              "note": "data crosses, behaviour does not"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Props Are Public",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "diagram",
              "kind": "flow",
              "spec": {
                "nodes": [
                  {
                    "text": "Server",
                    "sub": "renders tree",
                    "ink": "blue"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "RSC payload",
                    "sub": "includes props",
                    "ink": "purple"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Browser",
                    "sub": "visible in devtools",
                    "ink": "red"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Never pass ==secrets== or whole DB rows",
                "Pass only the **fields** the component needs"
              ],
              "style": "check"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "4. Common Mistake",
              "ink": "red"
            },
            {
              "type": "callout",
              "style": "sticky",
              "title": "Only plain objects can be passed to Client Components",
              "text": "You passed a ==function== or **class instance**. Pass plain data instead, or use a `'use server'` Server Action."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Composition Patterns",
      "role": "outline",
      "outlineIndex": 3,
      "pages": [
        {
          "title": "Composition Patterns",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. Children and Slots",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "==Children pattern==: a Client Component takes `children`, a Server Component fills it",
                "The Server child {green:stays on the server}",
                "==Slots==: any JSX prop works like children, e.g. `sidebar={<ServerSidebar />}`"
              ],
              "style": "dot"
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "lang": "tsx",
              "lines": [
                "<ClientShell sidebar={<ServerSidebar />}>",
                "  <ServerList />",
                "</ClientShell>"
              ],
              "note": "both Server components, rendered inside a Client shell"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. Providers and Leaves",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Context providers must be {purple:Client Components}",
                "Wrap them in `providers.tsx` with `'use client'`, render `{children}`",
                "The layout stays a ==Server Component=="
              ],
              "style": "check"
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "lang": "tsx",
              "lines": [
                "'use client'",
                "export function Providers({ children }) {",
                "  return <ThemeContext.Provider value=\"dark\">{children}</ThemeContext.Provider>",
                "}"
              ],
              "note": "providers.tsx"
            },
            {
              "type": "diagram",
              "kind": "chain",
              "spec": {
                "title": "Small leaves",
                "steps": [
                  {
                    "text": "Card",
                    "note": "Server",
                    "ink": "green"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "LikeButton",
                    "note": "Client leaf",
                    "ink": "blue"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Mistake",
              "ink": "red"
            },
            {
              "type": "callout",
              "style": "sticky",
              "title": "Client file imports a Server Component",
              "text": "The import turns it into ==client code==. Pass it as `children` or a prop instead."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "What Runs Where and Bundle Impact",
      "role": "outline",
      "outlineIndex": 4,
      "pages": [
        {
          "title": "What Runs Where and Bundle Impact",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. Request Flow",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "diagram",
              "kind": "flow",
              "spec": {
                "nodes": [
                  {
                    "text": "Server renders",
                    "sub": "Server Component tree",
                    "ink": "green"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "RSC payload",
                    "sub": "streamed, client refs",
                    "ink": "blue"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Browser merges",
                    "sub": "payload into DOM",
                    "ink": "purple"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Hydrate",
                    "sub": "client parts only",
                    "ink": "orange"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Client Components travel as ==references==, not inline code",
                "Server Component code and deps (markdown, date libs) cost ==zero client JS=="
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. Bundle Impact",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "",
                "Server Component",
                "Client Component"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "Imports reach browser?",
                  "{green:No}",
                  "{red:Yes}"
                ],
                [
                  "Client JS cost",
                  "Zero",
                  "Itself + everything it imports"
                ]
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "A heavy library imported in a Client Component ==inflates== the bundle",
                "Keep heavy libs in **Server Components**"
              ],
              "style": "check"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Guards and Secrets",
              "ink": "red"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "`import 'server-only'` in DB/secret modules: a Client Component import ==fails the build==",
                "`import 'client-only'` marks browser-only code"
              ],
              "style": "dot"
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "lang": "ts",
              "lines": [
                "// lib/db.ts",
                "import 'server-only'",
                "export const db = connect(process.env.DB_URL)"
              ],
              "note": "importing lib/db into a 'use client' file breaks the build"
            },
            {
              "type": "callout",
              "style": "sticky",
              "title": "Secrets in a Client Component",
              "text": "Only `NEXT_PUBLIC_` env vars are inlined into the browser bundle. Any other `process.env` value is ==undefined== there."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "RSC vs Client Cheat Sheet",
      "role": "outline",
      "outlineIndex": 5,
      "pages": [
        {
          "title": "RSC vs Client Cheat Sheet",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. Default: Server",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Add `'use client'` only for ==state==, ==effects==, ==event handlers==, ==browser APIs==, hook libraries"
              ],
              "style": "check",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. The Boundary",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "`'use client'` goes at the ==top of the file==, above imports",
                "Marks a **boundary**; push it down to leaves"
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "Import",
                "Result"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "Server imports Client",
                  "{green:OK}"
                ],
                [
                  "Client imports Server",
                  "{red:NO}: pass as `children` or props"
                ]
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Props and Providers",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Props must be ==serializable==",
                "No functions, except **Server Actions**",
                "Never pass secrets or whole DB rows"
              ],
              "style": "cross",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "lang": "tsx",
              "lines": [
                "'use client'",
                "export function Providers({ children }) {",
                "  return <Theme>{children}</Theme>",
                "}"
              ],
              "note": "layout stays a Server Component"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Guard modules: `import 'server-only'` or `'client-only'`",
                "Check bundle size: `next build` output or bundle analyzer"
              ],
              "style": "dot"
            },
            {
              "type": "callout",
              "style": "sticky",
              "title": "Remember",
              "text": "`'use client'` on a layout or page pulls the ==whole subtree== into the client bundle."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Check yourself",
      "role": "quiz",
      "pages": [
        {
          "title": "Check yourself",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "qa",
              "q": "A `'use client'` file `Shell.tsx` does `import ServerList from './ServerList'` and renders it. What goes wrong, and what is the fix?",
              "a_bullets": [
                "The import turns `ServerList` into client code, so its server-only work breaks or ships to the browser.",
                "Fix: render `<Shell><ServerList /></Shell>` from a Server Component and use `children`."
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "qa",
              "q": "A Server Component renders `<Button onClick={() => save()} />`, where `Button` is a Client Component. Result?",
              "a_bullets": [
                "Error: functions are not serializable props.",
                "Fix: move the handler into `Button`, or pass a Server Action marked `'use server'`."
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "qa",
              "q": "`app/layout.tsx` starts with `'use client'` and imports `Header` and `Footer` (no directive). Where do they run?",
              "a_bullets": [
                "Both join the client bundle, since everything the boundary file imports is client code.",
                "They are still pre-rendered to HTML on the server. Push `'use client'` down to the small interactive leaves."
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
